        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The concept of a 'dichotomy' between campaign rhetoric and governance is meaningful and recognizable in political discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      },
      {
        "text": "Political leaders who govern from a position far removed from the median voter will fail in achieving long-term success.",
        "confidence": 0.8
      },
      {
