        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views their role as inherently adversarial under the current presidential administration.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Public officeholders should derive motivation from ideological conviction rather than personal comfort.",
