        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political figures should reflect on the emotional and cognitive effects of collective action.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists shared understanding between the speaker and listener about what constitutes 'protest' and its significance.",
