      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker identifies strongly with progressive political values.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Grassroots activism is inherently legitimate and valuable.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Personal experience in past movements grants moral authority on current ones.",
